Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.65,0:00:13.77,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}大家好 我现在把Windows疯狂错误恶意软件2989.exe移植到了Windows 7上
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.65,0:00:13.77,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Hello everyone, I ported the Windows Crazy Error Malware 2989.exe to Windows 7 now,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.43,0:00:16.39,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我想稍微讲讲它是什么
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.43,0:00:16.39,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}and I want to talk a little bit about what it is,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.65,0:00:17.79,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它的破坏性有多强
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.65,0:00:17.79,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}how destructive it is,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.13,0:00:20.55,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}如何移除它 以及它的大致背景故事
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.13,0:00:20.55,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}how to remove it and generally its backstory.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.57,0:00:23.15,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}首先 我已经发布了它
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.57,0:00:23.15,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}First of all, I released it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.65,0:00:26.13,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}你可以在本地的回收站里找到它
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.65,0:00:26.13,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}You can find it inside your local recycle bin.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.91,0:00:28.65,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它现在支持Windows 7
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.91,0:00:28.65,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}It now supports Windows 7,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.91,0:00:31.51,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Windows 8 Windows 10和Windows 11
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.91,0:00:31.51,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Windows 8, Windows 10 and Windows 11.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.27,0:00:34.23,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我可不是无缘无故说“移植”
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.27,0:00:34.23,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}I didn't say port for no reason,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.91,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}因为它确实是原始恶意软件的实际移植版本
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.91,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}because it's an actual port of the original malware.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.69,0:00:42.93,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}原因在于 Windows 7 没有预装我使用的 xAudio 2 声音引擎
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.69,0:00:42.93,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}The reason is, Windows 7 does not come with the Sound Engine xAudio 2 I'm using out of the box,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.27,0:00:45.03,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以我把它移植到了 DirectSound 上
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.27,0:00:45.03,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}so I had to port it to DirectSound.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.71,0:00:48.41,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}这就是为什么在 Windows 7 上声音可能听起来有点不同
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.71,0:00:48.41,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}That's why it might sound a little different on Windows 7.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.79,0:00:49.93,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}可能稍微有点偏差
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.79,0:00:49.93,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}A little off, maybe.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.43,0:01:02.57,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Windows 7 上也没有现代通知提示
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.43,0:01:02.57,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}There are no modern notification toasts on Windows 7 either,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.67,0:01:05.07,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以我只能用经典的气泡提示来代替
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.67,0:01:05.07,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}so I had to substitute those with classic balloons.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.99,0:01:08.29,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}DPI 相关功能也仅适用于 Windows 10 及以上系统
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.99,0:01:08.29,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}The DPI stuff is also Windows 10 and up,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.47,0:01:09.99,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}不过你其实不用太担心这些
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.47,0:01:09.99,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}but you shouldn't really worry about it,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.05,0:01:11.39,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}这只是技术层面的事情
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.05,0:01:11.39,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}it's the technical side of things.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.17,0:01:14.11,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}那么 这到底是什么东西？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.17,0:01:14.11,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}So what even is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.03,0:01:17.07,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}这是一款实时疯狂错误恶意软件
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.03,0:01:17.07,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}It's a real-time crazy error malware.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.73,0:01:19.29,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我从未见过有人做过这种作品
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.73,0:01:19.29,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}I've never seen that done before,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.59,0:01:20.87,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以我就自己动手做了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.59,0:01:20.87,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}so that's why I made it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.65,0:01:24.49,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}显然 我的灵感来自那款4096版本
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.65,0:01:24.49,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Obviously, I've been inspired by the 4096 edit.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.09,0:01:26.65,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}你知道我说的是哪个
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.09,0:01:26.65,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}You know which one I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.29,0:01:28.25,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}大家都见过它
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.29,0:01:28.25,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Everybody has seen it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.05,0:01:33.47,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}我早在2024年初就开始制作它 作为我最终恶意软件的效果
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.05,0:01:33.47,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}I started making it early 2024 as a payload for my final malware,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.65,0:01:35.91,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}但最后我决定把它单独分离出来
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.65,0:01:35.91,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}but I ultimately decided to separate it out.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.63,0:01:39.31,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}本可能对电脑致命的程序
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.63,0:01:39.31,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}What could have been super harmful and deadly to the computer
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.31,0:01:43.43,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}最终变成了一场几乎无害的消息框表演
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.31,0:01:43.43,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}was turned into a practically harmless dance of message boxes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.93,0:01:45.17,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它不具有破坏性
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.93,0:01:45.17,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}It's not destructive,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.57,0:01:46.41,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}也不会持久存在
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.57,0:01:46.41,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}and it's not persistent.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.39,0:01:48.49,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}在Windows 10及以上系统
Dialogue: 2,0:01:47.39,0:01:48.49,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}On Windows 10 and up,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.59,0:01:50.61,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它会在临时文件夹内创建一个图片
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.59,0:01:50.61,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}it creates an image inside a temporary folder,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.91,0:01:52.35,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}并在开始菜单中创建一个快捷方式
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.91,0:01:52.35,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}and a shortcut in the start menu.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.01,0:01:56.13,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}因为我基本上被迫这么做 才能使用WinRT通知
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.01,0:01:56.13,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Because I'm basically forced to do it for WinRT toasts.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.87,0:01:58.75,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它修改一个注册表值
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.87,0:01:58.75,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}It changes one registry value,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.25,0:02:06.95,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它唯一真正恶意的地方是把自己设置为关键进程
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.25,0:02:06.95,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}The only truly malignant thing it does is it sets itself as a critical process,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.61,0:02:09.95,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以一旦运行就再也无法回头
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.61,0:02:09.95,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}so once you run it, there is no way back.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.33,0:02:11.61,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}它只会让系统崩溃
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.33,0:02:11.61,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}It's just gonna crash the system.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.89,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以运行前请务必保存好你的工作
Dialogue: 2,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.89,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}So make sure to save your work before you run it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.67,0:02:18.85,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}哦对了 它的文件名中还附带了一个从右到左的覆盖字符
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.67,0:02:18.85,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Oh, and also it comes with a right-to-left override character in its name,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:24.36,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1946.667,1799.666)}即将有强光闪烁！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.09,0:02:21.15,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}这让它变得更有意思一点
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.09,0:02:21.15,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}so that just makes it a little spicier.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.11,0:02:24.27,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}理想情况下 没有卸载过程
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.11,0:02:24.27,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}In an ideal case, there is no removal process,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.35,0:02:25.45,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}因为它不会持久存在
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.35,0:02:25.45,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}because it's not persistent.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.27,0:02:28.69,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}但如果它崩溃了 你知道该去哪里找
Dialogue: 2,0:02:26.27,0:02:28.69,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}But if it crashes, you know where to look.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.33,0:02:31.69,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}另外 请勿在真实硬件上运行它
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.33,0:02:31.69,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}And also, please don't run it on real hardware.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.35,0:02:33.55,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}因为它仍然是恶意软件
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.35,0:02:33.55,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Because it's still malware,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.89,0:02:35.05,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}而恶意软件会伤害电脑
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.89,0:02:35.05,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}and malware hurts computers.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.23,0:02:38.83,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}所以 关于这个能说的就这么多了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.23,0:02:38.83,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}So yeah, that's pretty much all I can say about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.25,0:02:39.89,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}祝观赏愉快！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.25,0:02:39.89,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}Enjoy the show!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.51,0:02:43.93,Enderman字幕中,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}这是在Windows 7上运行的2989.exe
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.51,0:02:43.93,Enderman字幕英,,0,0,0,,{\blur15.0}This is 2989.exe on Windows 7.
